  "location": "LCR31.29",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: LCR31.29",
      "summary": "LCR31.29 points to LCR31.7-31.10 as the jurisdiction's information base, but those paragraphs are bank-to-supervisor usage rules; the shortfall information sits in LCR31.24-31.28.",
      "impact": "Position: Jurisdiction preparing its LCR31.20(1)(b) factor submission Reading a: Follow reference literally: take LCR31.7-31.10 as the prior information base: nothing from the jurisdiction is found there, so the base is empty Reading b: Take LCR31.24-31.28 as the base: HQLA supply/demand data and shortfall method Difference: Different base for the factor commentary; no numeric effect",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
